copilot-plugin-cc, by tmathura, is a port of codex-plugin-cc
(https://github.com/openai/codex-plugin-cc).

Changes

Changed .mjs and .d.ts files say so in a comment at the top. The other changed files
are listed below. Each was changed from upstream codex-plugin-cc to use
GitHub Copilot instead of Codex:

- .claude-plugin/marketplace.json
- .github/workflows/pull-request-ci.yml
- README.md
- package.json
- package-lock.json
- tsconfig.prompt-mode.json (from tsconfig.app-server.json)

The plugin folder has its own NOTICE for the files in it.

Spec Kit

The development tooling below comes from Spec Kit (https://github.com/github/spec-kit),
version 1.1.3, and is not part of the plugin:

- .claude/skills/speckit-*
- .specify/, except .specify/memory/constitution.md and the bug notes in .specify/bugs/,
  which this repo wrote

